  texts:
  - "Go play the piano. One, two, three\u2014a slap on the hands; one, two, three\u2014a
    slap on the hands. And so on, every single time. I couldn't disobey her. Living
    like that for 15 years is no easy feat."
  - "Hello, sir, could you...\u2014a slap on the hands. Maybe I'll try something
    new...\u2014a slap on the hands. I want to be a writer...\u2014a slap on the
    hands.  *.slap on the hands*"
  - i got nothing to say
  notePadText: {fileID: 156251208}
